  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AU Youth Envoy Strategy Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Danish support is to enable the Office of the Youth Envoy (OYE) to translate the 2019/2020 Action Plan into a comprehensive programme that will enable the OYE to amass financial support to its implementation. This includes a detailed costing of the four proposed tracks of the Action Plan, development of a monitoring and evaluation framework with clear outcomes, outputs and timelines and development of concept notes for each of the proposed projects. 

Furthermore, the Danish support will enable the OYE to validate the Action Plan programme and launch the Action Plan during a high-level event at the African Union Commission headquarters in Addis Ababa.

Through these initiatives, the Danish support will allow the OYE to raise the required funding to implement the 2019/2020 Action Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
